    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan exchanges the rank seven transformation path Immortal Gu Dragon Breath from Lang Ya blessed land using over seventy thousand sect contribution points. He integrates that rank seven dragon breath Gu into sword dragon transformation; with the Immortal Gu he no longer needs dragon breath mortal Gu for that move. After the addition, he judges the sword dragon reaches ancient desolate beast level.",
